</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 883)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Closing the window silences it.</b> A frame&#8217;s audio slice looping under a scrub could go on after the window closed until Asobi quit; a closed window now stops playback and every sound, and a hold loop ends on its own after twenty seconds without a scrub.</li>
<li><b>Shift-I / Shift-O clear in one press</b> &#8212; the range and the clip&#8217;s own in/out together, instead of one then the other.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
