<h2>Asobi Review 0.9 (build 878)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Drop a zip on the window</b> and it is unpacked and sorted through: a session package inside opens, an invite is offered, media joins, and missing clips relink from it.</li>
<li>A missing clip&#8217;s marker says why (&#8220;couldn&#8217;t fetch: access denied&#8221;), and your host sees the same under your name.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
